WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:01,810
Wang Sheng

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,550
do you know what you are talking about

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,060
My husband just abandoned me and ran for his life

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,600
Now my husband actually asks me to work for Lin Dong

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,910
Don't get excited, Xiaoyue

6
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:18,110
You just need to help him clean up the house.

7
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,740
If Lin Dong dares to do harm to you

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,940
you cry out for help

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,090
If I hear this, I will rush in and save you.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,060
I'm already heartbroken for him

11
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,420
When faced with real disaster

12
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,100
I finally saw Wang Sheng’s true face clearly.

13
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,980
That's it for being as cowardly as a mouse and as weak as a piano.

14
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,640
He also wants to put on a layer of hypocritical mask Xiao Yue

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,100
I'm really not lying to you. You have to believe me.

16
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,800
Do you remember what I said about the principle of compromise for the happy?

17
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,080
We are the happy ones

18
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,160
The principle is that as long as you give in a little, good things will come of it.

19
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,120
Isn't that your cowardly excuse?

20
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,560
if you have the ability

21
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,360
You can definitely grab Lin Dong’s food

22
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:55,080
Why are we all starving here?

23
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,120
Why can't you listen? I mean well.

24
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,150
I'm going to work for Lin Dong
